{"id":"8efcec738ec44109","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-modal-system-types.md","title":"K4 Has Type 4 and G Has Type G","display":"prop-modal-system-types — K4 Has Type 4 and G Has Type G","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-modal-system-types","aliases":["92-prop-modal-system-types"],"display":"prop-modal-system-types — K4 Has Type 4 and G Has Type G","source":"第 XI 章 p. 133（PDF 150）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-associated-system]]","[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-modal-system-types"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-modal-system-types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-modal-system-types — K4 Has Type 4 and G Has Type G"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 133（PDF 150）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f403c224ddb070f8\" href=\"?note=f403c224ddb070f8\" title=\"92-df-modal-associated-system\">92-df-modal-associated-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\Box},\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\Box},\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}\\)</span> 见上游；Type4、TypeG 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type4},\\mathrm{TypeG}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type4},\\mathrm{TypeG}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a> 的五元组性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}modal\\text{-}system\\text{-}types}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Type4}(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}))&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{TypeG}(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(\\mathsf G_{\\Box})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Type4}(\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}))&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{TypeG}(\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(\\mathsf G_{\\Box})).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}modal\\text{-}system\\text{-}types}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Type4}(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}))&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{TypeG}(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(\\mathsf G_{\\Box})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Type4}(\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}))&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{TypeG}(\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(\\mathsf G_{\\Box})).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>重言式和 MP 给 Type1，Nec 给 Normal，A2/A3 给 Type4，A4 给 TypeG。letterless 域对这些构造封闭，同样满足条件；不是任何名为 G 的结构都有 TypeG。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-associated-system","status":"resolved","id":"f403c224ddb070f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-associated-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen